    <div class="section-header text-center d-block mb-4">
        <h2 class="section-title">Worn & Trusted by 50,000+ Athletes & Creators</h2>
        <div class="section-subtitle">Real experiences from customers who demand precision and performance every day.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="bg-white border rounded-3 p-4 h-100 shadow-sm d-flex flex-direction-column justify-content-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="text-warning mb-2">★★★★★</div>
                    <p class="fst-italic text-secondary mb-3" style="font-size: 0.94rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                        "The Aura Pro ANC headphones completely transformed my workflow. The build quality feels like a $500 studio unit. Fast shipping and the packaging was pure luxury."
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 pt-3 border-top">
                    <span class="badge bg-success-subtle text-success border border-success-subtle rounded-pill">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
                    <span class="fw-bold small text-dark">Marcus Z. — San Francisco</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="bg-white border rounded-3 p-4 h-100 shadow-sm d-flex flex-direction-column justify-content-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="text-warning mb-2">★★★★★</div>
                    <p class="fst-italic text-secondary mb-3" style="font-size: 0.94rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                        "The Apex Commuter backpack is indestructible. Rain slides right off the YKK AquaGuard zippers, and the suspended laptop compartment gives total peace of mind."
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 pt-3 border-top">
                    <span class="badge bg-success-subtle text-success border border-success-subtle rounded-pill">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
                    <span class="fw-bold small text-dark">Sophia B. — New York</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="bg-white border rounded-3 p-4 h-100 shadow-sm d-flex flex-direction-column justify-content-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="text-warning mb-2">★★★★★</div>
                    <p class="fst-italic text-secondary mb-3" style="font-size: 0.94rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                        "Super fast dispatch! The Chronos Field Watch has that rugged military look paired with Japanese automatic reliability. Hands down the best purchase this year."
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 pt-3 border-top">
                    <span class="badge bg-success-subtle text-success border border-success-subtle rounded-pill">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
                    <span class="fw-bold small text-dark">David L. — London</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
